DOWNLOAD TAMPER MONKEY (Chrome extension)
Reference if you need help with tampermonkey: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8tyjJD65zws&ab_channel=Tampermonkey

DISCLAIMER: For those of you who think this is a scam, it's not. Simply put, tamper monkey has been used for a decade and is used to interact with the console logs and html of a certain website and in this case blob.io.
    From there, we can code out our own scripts and all this script does is clicks t and space for unlimited self feed, so your computer does have to be turned on. If you have any concerns, put the script inside of chatgpt
    to see what it does for your own confirmation. 

Tips:
- Copy past the script from .js file and if you look closely at the heading you can adjust which servers you
want to run your self feed farm in
- You can add more '@match <url....>' after line 6
- If you add more urls, make sure to add them to line 23 which should look something like
    'const urls = [
        "http://custom.client.blobgame.io/?ip=139.99.8.156:4801",
        "http://custom.client.blobgame.io/?ip=139.99.8.156:4802",
        "http://custom.client.blobgame.io/?ip=139.99.8.156:4803",
        "http://custom.client.blobgame.io/?ip=139.99.8.156:4804",
        "http://custom.client.blobgame.io/?ip=139.99.8.156:4805",
        "http://custom.client.blobgame.io/?ip=139.99.8.156:4806",
        "http://custom.client.blobgame.io/?ip=139.99.8.156:4807"
    ];'
- Once you copy pasted the script, save the file, copy one of the urls, and you are set to go

